      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 504</b></color></size>\n<b>Bhagat Singh</b>\n<size=74%>1907\u20131931\n<i>Photograph</i>\nVarious collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nBhagat Singh was a young revolutionary of the Hindustan Socialist Republican Association. In April 1929 he and Batukeshwar Dutt threw harmless bombs into the Central Legislative Assembly in Delhi and courted arrest, using their trial to spread their ideas. He was hanged in Lahore in March 1931, aged 23.</size>\n<size=50%><color=#8A8A8A>Photo: Unknown authorUnknown author (Ramnath Photographers, Delhi) / Public domain / Wikimedia Commons</color></size>"
