  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 501</b></color></size>\n<b>The first Indian National Congress</b>\n<size=74%>28\u201331 December 1885\n<i>Photograph</i>\nVarious collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nSeventy-two delegates from across India met at Gokuldas Tejpal Sanskrit College in Bombay for the first session of the Indian National Congress, presided over by W. C. Bonnerjee. Early leaders such as Dadabhai Naoroji argued that British rule was draining India's wealth, and asked for a greater Indian voice in government.</size>\n<size=50%><color=#8A8A8A>Photo: Unknown authorUnknown author / Public domain / Wikimedia Commons</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
