  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 506</b></color></size>\n<b>Partition, August 1947</b>\n<size=74%>1947\n<i>Photograph</i>\nVarious collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nIndependence came with the partition of British India into India and Pakistan. Around fifteen million people crossed the new borders in Punjab and Bengal, and the violence claimed hundreds of thousands of lives \u2013 some estimates say up to two million. It was one of the largest migrations in human history.</size>\n<size=50%><color=#8A8A8A>Photo: Unknown authorUnknown author / Public domain / Wikimedia Commons</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
